{"seq":3,"slug":"pickup-collection-exception-handling","title":"上门取件与回收异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-collection-network/pickup-collection-exception-handling","wordCount":2821,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"上门取件与回收异常处置\">上门取件与回收异常处置</h1><p>回收网络的终点不是回收站，而是消费者家门前那条动线。当一台冰箱被承诺&quot;免费上门取走&quot;时，履约链条上就出现了所有电商团队都熟悉、却在合规文档里最常缺席的环节：<strong>取件失败</strong>。客户不在家、电梯进不去、旧机里还留着数据、司机发现是含制冷剂的危废设备而不愿装车——每次异常都在消耗合规回收率与利润。本节把上门取件拆成可管理的履约链路，给出异常分类与成本边界。渠道拓扑见<a href=\"takeback-channel-network-model\">回收渠道与回收点网络模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>上门取件（on-demand collection / pickup）</strong> 与门店回收、市政站点并列，但有三个独特属性：<strong>触发点是订单</strong>而非投放行为；<strong>取件与交付常被捆绑</strong>（送新机时顺带拉旧机）；<strong>取件失败率显著高于门店</strong>，因为履约依赖预约窗口、门禁条件与现场判断。</p>\n<p>法律上，上门取件从&quot;自愿的增值服务&quot;变成&quot;必须做到的能力&quot;，源自欧盟 WEEE 指令对经销商的带回收义务：指令 <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2012/19/article/5\">2012/19/EU 第 5(2)(b) 条</a>规定一对一带回（one-for-one）；当新设备<strong>配送到家</strong>时，&quot;用户交出旧设备的地点就是家&quot;。德国 <a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/elektrog_2015/__17.html\">ElektroG § 17(1)</a>把它写成明确要求：配送至私人家庭时，家即为交付地点，经销商必须&quot;为终端用户<strong>免费</strong>安排旧设备的<strong>取走（Abholung）</strong>&quot;。上门取件因此在带回收场景下不是可选项，而是法定义务的一种实现形态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[订单触发&lt;br/&gt;新购/换新/回收申请] --&gt; S[预约窗口&lt;br/&gt;时段+地址+品类申报]&#10;  S --&gt; P[上门执行&lt;br/&gt;司机/第三方承运]&#10;  P --&gt;|成功| T[旧机装车&lt;br/&gt;交接单+取证]&#10;  P --&gt;|失败| E[异常分流]&#10;  T --&gt; L[逆向运输&lt;br/&gt;ADR/制冷剂/电池限制]&#10;  L --&gt; H[归集点交接&lt;br/&gt;称重+品类核对]&#10;  H --&gt; C[合规凭据回写&lt;br/&gt;纳入EPR台账]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[改约]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[转门店/站点自送]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[收费再上门]&#10;  E --&gt; E4[关闭并降级处理]\">graph TD\n  O[订单触发&lt;br/&gt;新购/换新/回收申请] --&gt; S[预约窗口&lt;br/&gt;时段+地址+品类申报]\n  S --&gt; P[上门执行&lt;br/&gt;司机/第三方承运]\n  P --&gt;|成功| T[旧机装车&lt;br/&gt;交接单+取证]\n  P --&gt;|失败| E[异常分流]\n  T --&gt; L[逆向运输&lt;br/&gt;ADR/制冷剂/电池限制]\n  L --&gt; H[归集点交接&lt;br/&gt;称重+品类核对]\n  H --&gt; C[合规凭据回写&lt;br/&gt;纳入EPR台账]\n  E --&gt; E1[改约]\n  E --&gt; E2[转门店/站点自送]\n  E --&gt; E3[收费再上门]\n  E --&gt; E4[关闭并降级处理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>门店带回收</th>\n<th>市政/站点自送</th>\n<th>上门取件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触达成本</td>\n<td>低（利用既有店）</td>\n<td>低（利用既有站）</td>\n<td>高（每次出车）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户便利度</td>\n<td>中（需携机到店）</td>\n<td>低（需自行运输）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大件可行性</td>\n<td>差（&gt;50 cm 难搬运）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>唯一可行通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位捕获率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（大件尤其）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要失效模式</td>\n<td>店员拒收、无暂存</td>\n<td>弃置于路边</td>\n<td>爽约、门禁、拒绝装车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据销毁责任</td>\n<td>用户自担</td>\n<td>用户自担</td>\n<td>承运方需可验证擦除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"义务来源-什么时候取件是-必须-什么时候是-可选\">义务来源：什么时候取件是&quot;必须&quot;，什么时候是&quot;可选&quot;</h2><p>把上门取件做成功能之前，必须先判定它在目标国是<strong>法定义务</strong>还是<strong>增值服务</strong>，因为两者的成本承担方、SLA 容忍度与失败后果完全不同。</p>\n<p>德国体系把义务拆成三段。<strong>1:1 带回收</strong>：买新送新时免费取走同类同功能旧机。<strong>0:1 小件</strong>：任一外部尺寸不超过 <strong>25 cm</strong> 的旧设备必须应要求免费回收，<strong>不得以购买新机为条件</strong>，同类型每次最多 <strong>3 台</strong>。第三段是<strong>远程销售（Distanzhandel）</strong>——跨境卖家最容易踩空的一段（<a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/elektrog_2015/__17.html\">§ 17(1)</a>）。</p>\n<p>§ 17(2) 规定上述规则同样适用于&quot;使用远程通信手段的分销&quot;，但对&quot;免费上门取走&quot;做了<strong>品类限缩</strong>：免费上门仅限<strong>第 1、2、4 类</strong>（温度交换、屏幕 &gt;100 cm²、大型设备）。第 3、5、6 类（灯管、小型设备、小型 IT/电信设备）的 1:1，以及全部 25 cm 的 0:1，远程卖家<strong>不必上门</strong>，只需提供&quot;终端用户合理距离内的适当回收选项&quot;。这解释了为什么冰箱必须免费上门取，而一副耳机走寄回即可。</p>\n<p>另外，<strong>销售面积门槛在网络渠道按&quot;仓储与发货面积&quot;折算</strong>，而非店面面积。一个德国注册、仓库面积达标的跨境卖家，很可能已落入 § 17 义务范围，不因&quot;没有实体店&quot;而豁免（<a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/elektrog_2015/__18.html\">§ 18(3)</a> 还要求远程卖家在线上媒体显著位置展示取回渠道与数据删除提示）。</p>\n<p>另一条正在成形的线是<strong>维修与取件的接口</strong>：欧盟《维修权指令》(EU) 2024/1799 于 2024 年 7 月 10 日刊登公报，成员国须在 <strong>24 个月</strong>内转化为国内法（<a href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/press-room/20240419IPR20590/right-to-repair-parliament-approves-new-rules-to-promote-repairs\">欧洲议会新闻稿</a>）。它要求提供&quot;欧洲维修信息表&quot;，实际影响是越来越多取件请求其实是&quot;先判断能否修、再决定是否收走&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取件履约链路与责任分段\">取件履约链路与责任分段</h2><p>上门取件是一个<strong>责任分段</strong>的过程。<strong>第一段预约与资质申报</strong>是信息拦截点：申报品类、尺寸、数量、门禁条件与是否含电池，决定承运类型——温度交换设备需 F-gas 资质处理方，含锂电池设备受 ADR 危险品运输规则约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第二段现场执行</strong>：司机核对品类数量、检查危废特性（制冷剂、含汞背光、膨胀电池）、完成数据销毁或封存、出具交接单。<strong>第三段逆向运输</strong>的约束不是成本而是运输法规：温度交换设备不得与普通小件混装；破损锂电池属危险品，需按 ADR 特殊规定包装。<strong>第四段归集与凭据回写</strong>决定取件是否真的&quot;计入合规回收率&quot;——成功取件但凭据缺失，在监管口径上等于没发生。</p>\n<p>四段责任划分：<strong>预约申报</strong>归卖家/平台（漏报品类→现场拒收、取件作废）；<strong>上门执行</strong>与<strong>逆向运输</strong>归承运方（爽约、门禁不通、混装泄漏→义务未履行、危废违规）；<strong>归集回写</strong>归卖家/PRO（无凭据→回收率不被认可）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常分类与处置矩阵\">异常分类与处置矩阵</h2><p>取件的价值不在于&quot;大多数成功的取件&quot;，而在于<strong>异常是否被归因、被计量、被处置</strong>。最易被低估的是 E4 与 E5：E4 的根源是品类申报与危废识别脱节——外观完好的冰箱仍属温度交换设备，必须走专用通道，普通承运商装了车就是违规；E5 的根源是&quot;回收=垃圾&quot;的旧心智——回收设备携带个人信息，专业渠道必须做可验证擦除并出具证明。</p>\n<p>处置矩阵要落成<strong>代码里的状态机</strong>，而不是客服话术。每次取件请求应有明确终态：<code>collected</code>、<code>rescheduled</code>、<code>refused_hazardous</code>、<code>self_delivered</code>、<code>closed_no_action</code>。只有前两类计入回收量，其余必须进入异常台账，否则回收率会被系统性高估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常代码</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>现场处置</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n<th>成本归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>E1 爽约</td>\n<td>用户不在家 / 未接电话</td>\n<td>留通知、拍照取证</td>\n<td>一次免费改约，二次转自送</td>\n<td>卖家承担首次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 门禁/通道</td>\n<td>电梯尺寸不足、无卸货位</td>\n<td>现场评估，尝试人工搬运</td>\n<td>需吊装或拆窗时改约并报价</td>\n<td>用户承担例外搬运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 品类不符</td>\n<td>申报小件实为大件 / 数量超限</td>\n<td>按实际品类重新判定</td>\n<td>大件可收但可能触发收费</td>\n<td>卖家承担误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 危废拒绝</td>\n<td>制冷剂设备、膨胀锂电、含汞件</td>\n<td>拒绝普通装车</td>\n<td>转危废专线，隔离暂存</td>\n<td>卖家承担专线溢价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5 数据未清</td>\n<td>设备有锁定、有残留数据</td>\n<td>现场擦除或封存</td>\n<td>无擦除能力则拒收并说明</td>\n<td>卖家承担设备责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 运输损毁</td>\n<td>搬运中破损、泄漏</td>\n<td>终止装车、记录</td>\n<td>按危废应急流程处置</td>\n<td>承运方/保险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异常的成本边界与定价\">异常的成本边界与定价</h2><p>免费上门取件的成本不是单次出车费，而是<strong>期望成本</strong>——它把失败概率一并计入。设单次出车固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>、成功装车后每件可变成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、异常处置成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = F + p_s \\cdot v + \\sum_{i} p_i \\cdot e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是首次成功率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类异常的概率。最重要的含义是：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦出车就已沉没</strong>，因此降低期望成本的主战场不是压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，而是压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i \\cdot e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把 E1（爽约）从 25% 降到 10%，比把单次出车费砍 10% 更能省钱。</p>\n<p>定价结构则是&quot;义务内的免费 + 义务外的收费&quot;：1:1 带回收与 25 cm 的 0:1 不可收费，但<strong>例外搬运</strong>（吊装、拆窗、无电梯高层）、<strong>二次以上改约</strong>、<strong>超限数量</strong>可按公示价目表收费。红线是<strong>不能以收费规避免费义务本身</strong>——25 cm 场景下收费直接违反&quot;不得以购买为条件、不得收费&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把异常率做成可控指标\">把异常率做成可控指标</h2><p>工程化的做法是把取件从&quot;物流问题&quot;重构为&quot;数据问题&quot;。三个指标足以驱动改进：<strong>首次成功率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（反映预约质量与地址数据）、<strong>异常归因覆盖率</strong>（异常中有明确代码的比例，反映取证纪律）、<strong>凭据回写率</strong>（成功取件中已计入台账的比例，反映闭环完整度）。</p>\n<p>以欧盟量级作背景：2023 年欧盟 WEEE 回收率为 <strong>37.5%</strong>（按 2020–2022 年投放量均值计），人均 <strong>11.6 kg</strong>、合计约 <strong>520 万吨</strong>；仅保加利亚、拉脱维亚、斯洛伐克达到 65% 目标，捷克以 <strong>61.7%</strong> 接近，而在&quot;废弃产生量&quot;口径下达到 85% 的只有波兰——<a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Waste_statistics_-_electrical_and_electronic_equipment\">Eurostat，2025 年 10 月发布</a>。欧洲议会数据则显示 2021 年投放 1350 万吨、回收 490 万吨，<strong>回收率不足 40%</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/topics/en/article/20201208STO93325/e-waste-in-the-eu-facts-and-figures-infographic\">欧洲议会事实与数据</a>）。取件异常率是这条缺口里少数<strong>卖家可直接控制</strong>的变量。退货领域的基线可作参照：线上退货率约 <strong>20%</strong>、实体店约 <strong>8–10%</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_logistics\">Reverse logistics</a>），取件异常率通常同量级，应按&quot;必然发生的 15–25%&quot;设计流程。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>一个反直觉的结论：<strong>把取件异常率当 KPI 去压，可能反噬合规回收率。</strong> 若客服为达成&quot;异常率&lt;5%&quot;而拒绝难以处理的请求（E4 危废、E5 数据未清），异常率好看了，但危废混入普通流与回收义务未履行的风险同时上升。正确做法是<strong>分类计量</strong>：E1/E2 该压，E4/E5 该如实报告并转专线。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>上门取件是回收网络的第三条通道，<strong>触发点是订单</strong>，在带回收场景下从&quot;增值服务&quot;变成&quot;法定义务的实现形态&quot;。</li>\n<li>欧盟义务三层：<strong>1:1 带回收</strong>（第 5(2)(b) 条）、<strong>25 cm 的 0:1</strong>（第 5(2)(c) 条，≥400 m² 门店，不得以购买为条件）；德国 <a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/elektrog_2015/__17.html\">ElektroG § 17</a> 规定<strong>配送到家即以家为交付地，取件必须免费</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>远程销售的取件义务是限缩的</strong>：免费上门仅限第 1、2、4 类；第 3、5、6 类与 25 cm 回收只需提供合理距离内的回收选项。销售面积门槛按<strong>仓储与发货面积</strong>折算。</li>\n<li>履约链路分四段——<strong>预约申报 → 现场执行 → 逆向运输 → 归集回写</strong>；只有最后一段完成凭据回写，取件才计入合规回收率。</li>\n<li>异常六分类（E1 爽约 / E2 门禁 / E3 品类不符 / E4 危废拒绝 / E5 数据未清 / E6 运输损毁）必须落成状态机，<strong>终态区分&quot;已回收&quot;与&quot;未回收&quot;</strong>。</li>\n<li>成本模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = F + p_s v + \\sum_i p_i e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 说明出车费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦发生即沉没，<strong>主战场是压异常概率与异常成本</strong>；2023 年欧盟回收率 <strong>37.5%</strong>（Eurostat，2025-10）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本章节索引与其余文档见<a href=\"../\">回收网络与物流</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"上门取件与回收异常处置","id":"上门取件与回收异常处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"义务来源：什么时候取件是\"必须\"，什么时候是\"可选\"","id":"义务来源-什么时候取件是-必须-什么时候是-可选"},{"level":2,"text":"取件履约链路与责任分段","id":"取件履约链路与责任分段"},{"level":2,"text":"异常分类与处置矩阵","id":"异常分类与处置矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"异常的成本边界与定价","id":"异常的成本边界与定价"},{"level":2,"text":"把异常率做成可控指标","id":"把异常率做成可控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"逆向物流与危废运输机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-collection-network/reverse-logistics-hazardous-transport"},"next":{"title":"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/dismantling-recycling-process"}}